# ELE Language File Attributes
# *.l is the canonical extension of the ELE Systems Programming Language.
# Configured as linguist-language=Text to prevent GitHub from misclassifying .l sources as Lex/Flex.
# Official TextMate grammar for editor support is maintained at syntaxes/ele.tmLanguage.json.
*.l linguist-language=Text

# Benchmarks and artifacts
*.svg binary=false
*.json text
